Nobody tells you some ramen shops make you order from a machine 🍜
Know these 3 words and you'll never freeze at the machine.

Today's phrases:
• きかい (kikai) = Machine
• ボタン (botan) = Button
• どれですか (dore desu ka) = Which one is it?

